\noindent\small\textsuperscript{b}Long-document routing directs \texttt{claude-sonnet} to process the full document context
(${\sim}$6,700 input tokens vs.\ ${\sim}$4,000 for the \texttt{gpt-4o} baseline). The lower per-token cost of
