\section{Data Availability}

All data and materials used in this study are available. The ten Maryland policy
documents analysed are published by their issuing state agencies and are publicly
accessible; a manifest listing each document with its SHA-256 hash is provided so
that readers can verify they hold identical files. The control dataset, the
analysis notebook that reproduces every reported figure, and the ProofLayer
implementation are available at
\url{https://github.com/devharsh/ProofLayer}. The evaluated Stage 1 analysis
requires no API credentials and can be rerun from the manifest alone. Any further
material is available from the author on request.


